# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout regardless of platform.
# Without this, Windows checkouts convert text files to CRLF, changing
# their raw byte content — the golden-fixture tests in
# internal/bootstrap/golden_test.go hash rampart.yaml's bytes directly
# (report.json's config_hash), so a CRLF/LF mismatch there is a real
# cross-platform test failure, not just cosmetic.
* text=auto eol=lf
